F executable\n[9] 7ff7cfaad2d2 (main+4ffd2d2) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[10] 7ff7ce6c28a8 (main+3c128a8) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[11] 7ff7cafe56b0 (main+5356b0) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[12] 7ff7ce99197e (main+3ee197e) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[13] 7ff7caffa51f (main+54a51f) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[14] 7ff7ce9a79c7 (main+3ef79c7) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[15] 7ff7cab0cd00 (main+5cd00) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[16] 7ff7caaffb2e (main+4fb2e) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[17] 7ff7caaffbcd (main+4fbcd) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[18] 7ff7caab10c8 (main+10c8) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[19] 7ff7caab13f5 (main+13f5) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[20] 7ffe239ce956 (kernel32.dll+2e956) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[21] 7ffe2468ad6b (ntdll.dll+aad6b) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[22] -1 (main+-7ff7caab0001) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n-- END OF C++ BACKTRACE --\n================================================================\n\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAssign a resource to a script/scene that has export_tool_button assigned directly to a func()\nAssigning to a variable that assigns to another func variable will work.\n\n```gdscript\n@tool class_name BrokenReload extends Resource\nfunc _do() -> void: pass\n@export_tool_button(\"works\") var on_click1 = _do\n\n# Regression on Godot 4.8: comment this out to make project reload not crash\n@export_tool_button(\"breaks reload\") var on_click := func() -> void: _do()\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[broken-reload.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30359700/broken-reload.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","fo